# No Emojis Rule

## Policy

- **CRITICAL**: Never include emojis (pictographs, smileys, symbols, or other colored icons/glyphs) in any file in this repository.
- This applies to all file types including source code (.js, .html, .css), configuration, markdown documents (README.md, ROADMAP.md, CHANGELOG.md, etc.), and rules themselves.
- All headings, lists, summaries, and descriptions must use text and standard ASCII symbols only.
